A note on what this covers. The directory is a set of facts about public
websites, and facts are not copyrightable. What this licence covers is the
selection, the arrangement, and the written descriptions. Take the list, check
it yourself, and republish it. Sending corrections back is worth more to
everyone than the attribution is.
